  {
   "id": "oil-refinery-the-simulation-344242@3",
   "gameId": "oil-refinery-the-simulation-344242",
   "displayName": "Update 3",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-06-23T13:36:05.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve just released Update 3 for Oil Refinery: The Simulation, bringing two major additions to the game:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45577171/5169600bb12ef292cab7fe8f2c36f4d9f3cae9f0.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🚛 New Vehicle with Improved Physics",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new, smaller transport vehicle has been added, featuring completely reworked driving physics for smoother and more predictable handling. Existing vehicles still use the original system - this allows you to compare both and let us know which version you prefer. Your feedback will help shape the future of all vehicle handling in the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚓ New Harbor Location",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've expanded the game world with a brand-new Harbor area! Some delivery destinations have been relocated there to integrate this new location into your workflow. Expect the Harbor to become even more important in future updates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45577171/38752ad65c23a3aa641e2ab43f9c8765809d582b.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "💰 Looking Ahead: Update 4 – Market Forces",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Next up, we’ll be focusing on the economy system. Update 4 will introduce dynamic pricing and more player choice, making locations like the Harbor play a bigger strategic role.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚠️ Known Issue",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The new vehicle may display a visual glitch with the rear wheels on some systems. This does not affect gameplay and does not occur universally, but we are aware of the issue and working on a fix.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
